<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"	xmlns:sy="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/syndication/"	xmlns:admin="http://webns.net/mvcb/" xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#"	xmlns:atom="http://purl.org/atom/ns#" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/"><channel><title><![CDATA[www.espn.com - NFL]]></title><description>Latest NFL news from www.espn.com</description><link>https://www.espn.com</link><ttl>30</ttl><language>en</language><generator>ESPN Inc. https://www.espn.com</generator><copyright>Copyright 2015 ESPN Inc.</copyright><lastBuildDate>Mon, 28 Sep 2026 13:57:03 GMT</lastBuildDate><image><url>https://a.espncdn.com/i/espn/teamlogos/lrg/trans/espn_dotcom_black.gif</url><title>www.espn.com - NFL</title><link>https://www.espn.com</link><width>110</width><height>110</height></image><item><title><![CDATA[Trouble brewing for the Patriots? Barnwell on five important Week 3 losses and their aftermath]]></title><description><![CDATA[The Pats got blown out. The Seahawks lost to a QB2. The Panthers couldn't overcome injuries. The Chargers and Texans fell to 0-3. What now for five of last season's playoff teams?]]></description><dc:creator><![CDATA[Bill Barnwell]]></dc:creator><link><![CDATA[https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/50043253/week-3-losses-seahawks-patriots-texans-chargers-panthers]]></link><pubDate>Mon, 28 Sep 2026 09:23:46 EST</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false"><![CDATA[US-EN-50043253]]></guid></item><item><title><![CDATA[3.6% lost win probability, 2,870 days and 3.19 seconds: Our 'Next Ben Stats' from Week 3]]></title><description><![CDATA[Coaching decisions costing the Texans? Milestones for a Commanders LB and Raiders-Saints TEs? And more.]]></description><dc:creator><![CDATA[Ben Solak]]></dc:creator><link><![CDATA[https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/50043815/week-3-key-stats-numbers-solak]]></link><pubDate>Mon, 28 Sep 2026 09:23:46 EST</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false"><![CDATA[US-EN-50043815]]></guid></item><item><title><![CDATA[Sources: Giants pass rusher Burns believed to have torn ACL]]></title><description><![CDATA[New York Giants standout pass rusher Brian Burns is believed to have sustained a torn ACL during Sunday's 12-7 win over the Tennessee Titans, sources told ESPN's Adam Schefter and NFL Network's Ian Rapoport.]]></description><dc:creator><![CDATA[Jordan Raanan]]></dc:creator><link><![CDATA[https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/50051321/sources-giants-brian-burns-believed-torn-acl]]></link><pubDate>Mon, 28 Sep 2026 09:12:47 EST</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false"><![CDATA[US-EN-50051321]]></guid></item><item><title><![CDATA[Payton: Broncos can't keep relying on comebacks]]></title><description><![CDATA[In their latest wild ending, the Broncos rebounded from a first-half shutout to score a 30-26 victory over the Rams.]]></description><dc:creator><![CDATA[Jeff Legwold]]></dc:creator><link><![CDATA[https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/50050195/after-broncos-latest-comeback-payton-pushes-stronger-starts]]></link><pubDate>Mon, 28 Sep 2026 09:12:47 EST</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false"><![CDATA[US-EN-50050195]]></guid></item><item><title><![CDATA[Commanders LB Chenal to have season-ending neck surgery, sources confirm]]></title><description><![CDATA[Commanders linebacker Leo Chenal, who was carted off the field during the team's win over the Seahawks on Sunday, will undergo season-ending neck surgery, sources confirmed to NFL Network.]]></description><dc:creator><![CDATA[John Keim]]></dc:creator><link><![CDATA[https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/50051498/sources-leo-chenal-season-ending-neck-surgery]]></link><pubDate>Mon, 28 Sep 2026 09:12:47 EST</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false"><![CDATA[US-EN-50051498]]></guid></item><item><title><![CDATA[Saints confused after again ending up on losing end of fumble ruling]]></title><description><![CDATA[The Saints walked away from Sunday's home loss to the Raiders just as confused about the application of the quarterback fumble rules as they were in Week 1.]]></description><dc:creator><![CDATA[Katherine Terrell]]></dc:creator><link><![CDATA[https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/50049529/saints-again-losing-end-controversial-fumble-ruling]]></link><pubDate>Mon, 28 Sep 2026 09:12:47 EST</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false"><![CDATA[US-EN-50049529]]></guid></item><item><title><![CDATA[Ravens win in wild finish after Cowboys' kick paves way to Loop walk-off FG]]></title><description><![CDATA[Lamar Jackson, Tyler Loop and the Ravens delivered one of the most remarkable last-second victories in recent NFL history Sunday, thanks to a late fourth-quarter decision made by the Cowboys.]]></description><dc:creator><![CDATA[Jamison Hensley]]></dc:creator><link><![CDATA[https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/50049488/ravens-stun-cowboys-final-seconds-loop-gains-redemption]]></link><pubDate>Mon, 28 Sep 2026 09:12:47 EST</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false"><![CDATA[US-EN-50049488]]></guid></item><item><title><![CDATA[Bucs QB Mayfield has dislocated thumb, will undergo MRI]]></title><description><![CDATA[Buccaneers quarterback Baker Mayfield suffered a dislocated right thumb in the fourth quarter of Sunday's 23-16 loss to the Vikings, coach Todd Bowles said.]]></description><dc:creator><![CDATA[Jenna Laine]]></dc:creator><link><![CDATA[https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/50047972/bucs-qb-baker-mayfield-dislocated-thumb-undergo-mri]]></link><pubDate>Mon, 28 Sep 2026 09:12:47 EST</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false"><![CDATA[US-EN-50047972]]></guid></item><item><title><![CDATA[Sources: Commanders set for Ekeler reunion, will add veteran to RB room]]></title><description><![CDATA[The Commanders are expected to sign free agent running back Austin Ekeler to their 53-man roster, pending a physical, sources told NFL Network's Ian Rapoport and Mike Garafolo.]]></description><dc:creator><![CDATA[John Keim]]></dc:creator><link><![CDATA[https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/50051074/commanders-set-re-add-austin-ekeler-rb-room-sources-say]]></link><pubDate>Mon, 28 Sep 2026 09:12:47 EST</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false"><![CDATA[US-EN-50051074]]></guid></item><item><title><![CDATA[Injured Jefferson exits Vikings' victory, was 'close' to returning]]></title><description><![CDATA[Vikings star receiver Justin Jefferson was ruled out of Sunday's game against the Tampa Bay Buccaneers after a first-quarter injury to his left ankle.]]></description><dc:creator><![CDATA[Kevin Seifert]]></dc:creator><link><![CDATA[https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/50046851/vikings-rule-justin-jefferson-ankle-injury]]></link><pubDate>Mon, 28 Sep 2026 09:12:47 EST</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false"><![CDATA[US-EN-50046851]]></guid></item><item><title><![CDATA[😈 Ravens poke fun after win in Rio, topping trolls]]></title><description><![CDATA[The Washington Commanders followed up their upset victory over the Seattle Seahawks with a petty post.]]></description><dc:creator><![CDATA[Anthony Gharib]]></dc:creator><link><![CDATA[https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/50046373/nfl-week-3-trolls-2026]]></link><pubDate>Mon, 28 Sep 2026 09:12:47 EST</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false"><![CDATA[US-EN-50046373]]></guid></item><item><title><![CDATA[Big wins for the Broncos, Ravens, Jags and Steelers? Our reporters make sense of Week 3]]></title><description><![CDATA[Our NFL Nation reporters react to all the action, answering the biggest questions coming out of each Sunday game. Here's what we learned from Week 3.]]></description><dc:creator><![CDATA[NFL Nation]]></dc:creator><link><![CDATA[https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/50043408/week-3-sunday-games-takeaways-questions-2026]]></link><pubDate>Mon, 28 Sep 2026 09:24:51 EST</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false"><![CDATA[US-EN-50043408]]></guid></item><item><title><![CDATA[Let's overreact to NFL Week 3: Brock Purdy is the MVP front-runner?]]></title><description><![CDATA[Is Brock Purdy the MVP frontrunner? Are the Steelers going to have another winning season? We're judging Week 3 overreactions.]]></description><dc:creator><![CDATA[Dan Graziano]]></dc:creator><link><![CDATA[https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/50043224/week-3-overreactions-2026-graziano]]></link><pubDate>Mon, 28 Sep 2026 09:24:51 EST</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false"><![CDATA[US-EN-50043224]]></guid></item><item><title><![CDATA['This one hurts': How are Cowboys reacting to third straight 1-2 start?]]></title><description><![CDATA[Dallas finished 7-9-1 in 2025 and 7-10 in 2024 after winning one of its first three games. Will 2026 be any different?]]></description><dc:creator><![CDATA[Todd Archer]]></dc:creator><link><![CDATA[https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/50051416/nfl-dallas-cowboys-dak-prescott-baltimore-ravens-rio-de-janeiro-field-goal]]></link><pubDate>Mon, 28 Sep 2026 09:54:25 EST</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false"><![CDATA[US-EN-50051416]]></guid></item><item><title><![CDATA[DeVonta Smith is Eagles' undisputed No. 1 WR. He was shaped by perseverance]]></title><description><![CDATA[The Eagles' go-to guy in key moments has always seen himself as WR1 -- now everyone else is just catching up.]]></description><dc:creator><![CDATA[Tim McManus]]></dc:creator><link><![CDATA[https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/50042344/philadelphia-eagles-devonta-smith-wr1-post-aj-brown-mnf]]></link><pubDate>Mon, 28 Sep 2026 08:56:35 EST</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false"><![CDATA[US-EN-50042344]]></guid></item><item><title><![CDATA[Where has Bears TE Colston Loveland been this season?]]></title><description><![CDATA[The tight end has one catch and faces a tough Eagles defense on MNF. With no Caleb Williams, can he get going?]]></description><dc:creator><![CDATA[Courtney Cronin]]></dc:creator><link><![CDATA[https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/50044351/where-chicago-bears-te-colston-loveland-season]]></link><pubDate>Mon, 28 Sep 2026 08:56:35 EST</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false"><![CDATA[US-EN-50044351]]></guid></item><item><title><![CDATA[Patrick Mahomes perfect on play-action passes in win vs. Dolphins: 'It's opening up a lot']]></title><description><![CDATA[Mahomes completed all 14 of his play-action attempts for 201 yards, including a touchdown, according to ESPN Research.]]></description><dc:creator><![CDATA[Nate Taylor]]></dc:creator><link><![CDATA[https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/50049468/chiefs-patrick-mahomes-play-action-passes-dolphins-travis-kelce-kenneth-walker-iii]]></link><pubDate>Mon, 28 Sep 2026 07:48:48 EST</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false"><![CDATA[US-EN-50049468]]></guid></item><item><title><![CDATA[Joe Burrow, Bengals can't 'close it out' against Steelers]]></title><description><![CDATA[Special teams gaffes and a Burrow fumble late in the fourth sealed Cincinnati's outcome.]]></description><dc:creator><![CDATA[Ben Baby]]></dc:creator><link><![CDATA[https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/50048227/joe-burrow-cincinnati-bengals-cant-close-steelers]]></link><pubDate>Mon, 28 Sep 2026 07:48:48 EST</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false"><![CDATA[US-EN-50048227]]></guid></item><item><title><![CDATA[Cardinals rookie Jeremiyah Love earns bigger role in offense]]></title><description><![CDATA[The running back out of Notre Dame rushed 21 times for 90 yards and caught five passes, including a TD.]]></description><dc:creator><![CDATA[Josh Weinfuss]]></dc:creator><link><![CDATA[https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/50049013/cardinals-rookie-jeremiyah-love-earns-bigger-role-offense]]></link><pubDate>Mon, 28 Sep 2026 07:48:48 EST</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false"><![CDATA[US-EN-50049013]]></guid></item><item><title><![CDATA[Week 3 winners and losers: Gibbs, Smith-Njigba stay hot; St. Brown, Taylor go quiet]]></title><description><![CDATA[Jahmyr Gibbs and Jaxon Smith-Njigba came up big in Week 3, while Amon-Ra St. Brown and Jonathan Taylor had very quiet days.]]></description><dc:creator><![CDATA[Matt Bowen and Tristan H. Cockcroft]]></dc:creator><link><![CDATA[https://www.espn.com/fantasy/football/story/_/page/FF