s cool': Trevor Lawrence's 1-yard line kneel hurt fantasy managers more than the actual game]]></title><description><![CDATA[The quarterback laughed off his clock-killing blunder, acknowledging the obvious fantasy implications after he knelt instead of running into the end zone.]]></description><dc:creator><![CDATA[Michael Dirocco]]></dc:creator><link><![CDATA[https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/50046652/jaguars-trevor-lawrence-kneel-eight-minutes-fantasy-implications]]></link><pubDate>Sun, 27 Sep 2026 18:48:31 EST</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false"><![CDATA[US-EN-50046652]]></guid></item><item><title><![CDATA[NFL betting buzz: 8.5 the magic number for underdogs]]></title><description><![CDATA[The four straight-up wins by underdogs of eight points or greater are the most through three weeks of an NFL season since 1978.]]></description><dc:creator><![CDATA[ESPN]]></dc:creator><link><![CDATA[https://www.espn.com/espn/betting/story/_/id/49466506/nfl-betting-buzz-odds-updates-line-moves-spreads]]></link><pubDate>Mon, 28 Sep 2026 09:11:24 EST</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false"><![CDATA[US-EN-49466506]]></guid></item><item><title><![CDATA[NFL draft risers, notes off Saturday's college games: Is Colin Simmons the class's clear top edge rusher?]]></title><description><![CDATA[Will Colin Simmons be the runaway top edge for 2027? How early could Jadan Baugh get picked in April? Here's NFL draft spin off Week 4 of the CFB season.]]></description><dc:creator><![CDATA[Mel Kiper Jr. and Jordan Reid]]></dc:creator><link><![CDATA[https://www.espn.com/nfl/draft2027/story/_/id/49881131/2027-nfl-draft-risers-questions-college-football-prospects]]></link><pubDate>Sun, 27 Sep 2026 22:02:12 EST</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false"><![CDATA[US-EN-49881131]]></guid></item></channel></rss>